{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cff1PoMRRyHScr1y1eCZN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"VERDICT: LGTM\n\nThe consolidation is coherent, additive, and idiomatic:\n\n- **Single-sourced key shape.** `Owner.identityKey(...)` is the one place the `tel|email|household` shape is defined, and `getIdentityKey()` delegates to it. `EnsureUniqueIdentity` reuses the same composer rather than re-spelling the format, so the entity getter and the create-time check cannot drift.\n\n- **Genuine de-duplication.** Moving `deriveHouseholdId` out of `AssignHousehold` into `Households` is a real improvement: the id used when *joining* a household and the id folded into the *duplicate check* now come from the same method. Exposing both `householdId(raw)` and `deriveHouseholdId(normalized)` is justified by the two callers having data at different normalization stages.\n\n- **Right units, net reduction.** Three exception classes, two handlers, three `EnsureUnique*` functions, and their escalation YAMLs collapse into one of each. The surviving `EnsureUniqueIdentity` has a single clear responsibility and reads cleanly against the pipeline.\n\n- **Idiomatic to this codebase.** `@Transient public getIdentityKey()` follows the existing derived-getter pattern on `Owner` (e.g. the `EMAIL`/`PHONE` contact-channel getter just above it), which is also how the new `identityKey` field surfaces in the OpenAPI schema. Transactions/governance on the new step match the former steps.\n\n- **Docs kept in sync.** `OwnerEmails`, `OwnerTelephones`, `Households`, and `AssignHousehold` javadocs were all repointed to the new key-based check rather than left dangling at the deleted classes.\n\nNo duplicated logic, no class turning into a catch-all. A maintainer would find this natural."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21111,"cache_read_input_tokens":11894,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21111},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70e52f3d-02ef-4c41-a667-adbb3a147b8f","uuid":"986b196c-c597-414a-8107-87185f008f0e","timestamp":"2026-10-03T08:43:57.948Z","request_id":"req_011Cff1Po7YE4khDpT295kwM"}
